  "title": "TextEditIntent",
  "description": "One edit the host wants applied to the text model. `insert` carries the text to place over the current selection (an IME commit, a typed character, a paste); `deleteContent` removes the selection, or the range a granularity step spans next to the caret; `historyUndo`/`historyRedo` ask for the widget's own undo ring, not the host's.",
